test-results/

# Playwright screenshot baselines, under both the old explicit path and the
# default one Playwright picks per spec file. Deliberately not committed: a
# pixel baseline is renderer-, font- and platform-specific, so keeping one per
# platform meant ~2 MB of PNG that had to be recaptured on a hosted runner and
# visually reviewed on every font, Chromium or UI change. The browser suite
# asserts accessibility, layout geometry and behavior instead; see
# docs/webui/design-system.md.
tests/screenshots/
tests/*-snapshots/
